{{{ intrinsics spoilers follow }}}

someone wanted to know what certain feelings meant ... you get a
feeling when you acquire (or lose) an intrinsic attribute. you get
feelings at other times too so you've got to sort it out. here's a
partial list of feelings and intrinsics:
sleep resist          = you feel wide awake
cold resist           = you feel full of hot air
fire resist           = you feel a momentary chill
poison resist         = you feel healthy
shock resist          = your health currently feels amplified!
                        (seems to me this should be "you feel insulated")
disintegration resist = you feel very firm
teleportation         = you feel very jumpy
teleport control      = you feel controlled (or)
                         you feel in control of yourself
warning               = you feel sensitive
invisibility          = you feel hidden
lycanthropy           = you feel feverish
and so on ...

